# TypeScript and TSX are text, whatever byte a string literal happens to hold.
#
# Row.tsx carried a NUL as a list separator, so git classified a focus-critical
# file as binary: `git diff` said only "Binary files differ", and a review - human
# or automated - saw none of it. The escape is fixed at the source, but the base
# side of a diff can still carry one, and one stray control character should not
# be able to hide a source file from review again.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.js diff
*.jsx diff
